%U A393855 131401,147525,164917,183625,203697,225181,248125,272577,298585,326197,355461,386425,419137
%N A393855 Sum of the distinct entries in the central row and central column of the (2*n + 1) X (2*n + 1) square array formed by the integers 1, 2, ..., (2*n + 1)^2 in order.
%C A393855 The sum of the entries on the two main diagonals gives the same sequence.
%H A393855 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calculator#Key_layout">Calculator (Key layout)</a>.
%F A393855 a(n) = (4*n + 1)*(2*n^2 + 2*n + 1).
%e A393855 a(0) = 1. For n = 1, the array is the usual 3 X 3 calculator digit layout:
%e A393855 7 8 9
%e A393855 4 5 6
%e A393855 1 2 3
%e A393855 and a(1) = 2 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 8 = 25.
%Y A393855 Cf. A399589, A399778.
%K A393855 nonn,new
%O A393855 0,2
